# Secrets
.env
.env.local

# Raw corpus: 493 MB, fetched by `make data`
data/raw/

# The combined episode file is derivable from the three splits, which ARE
# committed because `make reproduce` rebuilds the retrieval index from them
# (2.4 seconds) rather than shipping an 18 MB pickle.
data/interim/episodes_GWRHelp.parquet
artifacts/*.pkl

# Per-day request counter, not a result
artifacts/.rpd_state.json

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store

# Deliberately NOT ignored, because the reviewer needs them:
#   artifacts/cache/       1.3 MB of cached LLM responses -> `make reproduce`
#                          runs with no API key and no network
#   artifacts/runs/        the raw per-example outputs behind every table
#   artifacts/metrics/     computed results
#   data/golden/           the golden set and its full provenance
#   data/interim/*.parquet the chronological splits (3 MB)
#   data/interim/brand_scorecard.csv  evidence for the brand choice

# Internal working notes, not part of the submission
STATUS.md
